# roadmap 6.F2: fantasy_draft.lua with draft_probe.lua. Four players join; the draft starts on
# team select with four drafters and four picks in snake order (1 2 3 4: one pick each) and
# ends with four different players, one for each place. At tip-off the four players on court
# are the drafted ones (their attribute tables: places 1 0 4 3 in lib/draft_pool.lua).
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/fantasy_draft.lua
extra draft_probe.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse
frames 12001
nolog error
nolog not available
once fantasy draft: 4 drafters, 4 picks
once fantasy draft: pick 1, player 1 takes
once fantasy draft: pick 2, player 2 takes
once fantasy draft: pick 3, player 3 takes
once fantasy draft: pick 4, player 4 takes
once fantasy draft: done, P1 Stacey Augmon, P2 Danny Manning, P3 Xavier McDaniel, P4 Dee Brown
once tipoff places 1 0 4 3
